    {
     "t": "text",
     "html": "<p><img data-ref=\"https://www.thehighway90.com/wp-content/uploads/2025/04/420-website-save-the-date-1.png\" alt=\"Save the date for 420 deals at highway 90 dispensary. 4/20 deals near me. Evesham, new jersey. Cannabis deals near me\"></p><p><strong>Highway 90’s 2nd Annual 4/20 Fest: Three Days. One Epic Celebration. All at Highway 90 in Marlton!</strong></p><p>420 is more than just a date—it’s a <em>culture</em>, a <em>vibe</em>, and a time to come together and celebrate the plant we all love. This year, we’re going BIGGER and BETTER with our <strong>2nd Annual 4/20 Weekend Celebration</strong>, and you’re invited!</p><p>While we’re keeping our biggest deals under wraps for now 👀, we <em>can</em> promise an unforgettable weekend packed with <strong>store-wide savings</strong>, <strong>awesome giveaways</strong>, <strong>live entertainment</strong>, and a stacked schedule of brand pop-ups and local flavor.</p><h3>💥 Here’s What to Expect:</h3><p>🍃 <strong>Premium Brand &amp; Vendor Pop-Ups</strong><br>Meet your favorite cannabis brands face-to-face, learn more about their products, and score exclusive swag with your favorite products.</p><p>🎶 <strong>Live Music All Weekend</strong><br>Feel the vibe with local musicians bringing the energy—from chill afternoon sets to upbeat evening jams.</p><p>🌭 <strong>Local Eats &amp; Food Trucks</strong><br>Come hungry! We’re featuring some of the best local food trucks serving up hot dogs, cheesesteaks, and other munchie must-haves.</p><p>🛍️ <strong>Goodie Bags &amp; Giveaways</strong><br>Early birds and lucky winners will get hooked up with limited edition swag, branded goodies, and maybe even a few surprises.</p><p>🔥 <strong>Massive Store-Wide Discounts</strong><br>We can’t reveal the full list just yet, but trust us—<em>you’ll want to stock up.</em></p><p>✨ <strong>Exclusive Products &amp; Surprise Drops</strong><br>Be on the lookout for one-time drops and limited items only available during our 4/20 celebration.</p><h3>📅 4/20 Weekend Lineup:</h3><p><strong>Friday, April 18</strong><br>Kick things off with early deals, music, and your favorite brands.</p><ul><li><p><strong>Stashhouse/Victory Farms: <a href=\"/brands/drool/\">Drool</a>, Major &amp; <a href=\"/?s=cheeba+chews\">Cheeba Chews</a></strong> | 12:30–2:30 PM</p></li><li><p><a href=\"/?s=high+grass+farms\"><strong>High Grass Farms / Jersey Landscapes</strong> </a>| 4–6 PM</p></li><li><p><a href=\"/brands/flower-by-edie-parker/\"><strong>Edie Parker</strong></a> | 6–8 PM</p></li><li><p>🎉 Store-wide discounts begin!</p></li></ul><p><strong>Saturday, April 19</strong><br>Vibes in full swing—live music, munchies, and more brands in-store.</p><ul><li><p><a href=\"/?s=growfather\"><strong>Little Leaf Labs /The Growfather </strong></a> | 3–5 PM</p></li><li><p>🧀 <a href=\"https://www.jccfoods.com/menu/the-cheesesteak-guy/\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\"><strong>The Cheesesteak Guy</strong></a> food truck</p></li><li><p>🎵 Live music throughout the day</p></li><li><p>🛍️ Ongoing store-wide deals</p></li></ul><p><strong>Sunday, April 20 (The Big Day!)</strong><br>The main event! Celebrate 4/20 the right way—with good vibes, good music, good food, and amazing deals.</p><ul><li><p><a href=\"/brands/clade9/\"><strong>Clade9</strong></a> | 12–2 PM</p></li><li><p><a href=\"/brands/jersey-smooth/\"><strong>Jersey Smooth</strong></a> | 12–2 PM</p></li><li><p>🌭 <a href=\"https://www.facebook.com/ROCKSDOGSANDCATERINGLLC/\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\"><strong>Rocks Dogs</strong> </a>serving up hot dogs</p></li><li><p>🎸 Live Music</p></li><li><p>🔥 Store-wide discounts all day long!</p></li></ul><h3>✅ Save the Date. Spread the Word. Bring Your Friends.</h3><p>Whether you’re stocking up, vibing out, or just stopping by to enjoy the scene—<strong>Highway 90 is <em>the</em> place to be this 4/20 weekend</strong>. Follow us on social and subscribe to our emails so you’re first to know when our official deals drop!</p><p>📍 <strong>Highway 90 Dispensary</strong><br><em>Marlton, NJ</em></p><p>Let’s make this 4/20 one to remember. See you there! 💚</p><p><img data-ref=\"https://www.thehighway90.com/wp-content/uploads/2025/04/Copy-of-HWY90-square-2025-04-11T110259.880.png\" alt=\"420 cannabis deals near me in marlton new jersey\"></p>",
     "from": "content"
    }
